  "details": "It would be useful to have an event in Udon that fires when the player's \"grounded\" value changes, as returned by VRCPlayerAPI.IsPlayerGrounded()\n\nUse cases: \n\n* Determining when someone jumps/lands for playing a jumping/landing sound effect.\n\n* Resetting variables on scripts related to jumping movement (Double jump, etc)\n\nThis would move logic out of Update() if there was an event that could be relied on instead.",
